{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1412605-transformation-to-powerfull-for-its-exp-value","id":1412605,"title":"Transformation to powerfull for its exp value ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-08T08:54:30-07:00","id":1412605,"title":"Transformation to powerfull for its exp value ?","content":"Transformation at higher ranking is just getting incredible powerful, for its value in exp. To give a few examples:<br /> Transformation 2 + extra trait x 2 = 24exp : you get 6 dots - 6 power dots equals 6x12 = 72exp<br /> Transformation 4 + extra trait x 2 = 72exp : you get 12 dots - 12 power dots equals 12x12 = 144exp<br /> Transformation 4 + extra trait x 4 = 96exp : you get 20 dots - 20 power dots equals 20x12 = 240exp<br /> Transformation 6 + extra trait x 4 = 120exp : you get 30 dots - 30 power dots equals 30x12 = 360exp<br /> Transformation 6 + extra trait x 6 = 144exp : you get 42 dots - 42 power dots equals 42x12 = 504exp<br /> <br /> So someone who have this power, get loads of power dots to use for also no exp cost. They can swap them around at anytime, among alot of different options. Add a duration tag and it last for hours also. It seems to me that it aint really balanced at all.<br /> <br /> I like the power, but perhaps the extra traits tag need a balance before the book gets printed. Perhaps extra traits should give a fixed amount each time you take it, or give you the option to buy extra power dots for x exp each up to y times.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26399-asolar","name":"Asolar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:",